Section VIII

Debauchery
Art. 149. (Am. - SG, No. 28 of 1982, in force from 01.07.1982, am. - SG, No. 89 of 1986) (1) (Am. - SG, No. 107 of 1996, am. - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006) Whoever commits an act with the purpose of arousing or satisfying sexual desire without intercourse with respect to a person who has not attained 14 years of age shall be punished for lewdness with deprivation of liberty from one to six years.
(2) (Am. - SG, No. 107 of 1996, suppl. - SG, No. 27 of 2009, am. - SG, No. 74 of 2015) For lewdness the punishment is deprivation of liberty from two to eight years when committed:
1. through the use of force or threat;
2. through bringing the victim into a helpless state;
3. through taking advantage of the helpless state of the victim;
4. through taking advantage of a position of dependence or supervision;
5. with respect to a person who engages in prostitution.
(3) (Am. - SG, No. 107 of 1996, am. - SG, No. 38 of 2007) When the act under the preceding paragraphs is committed repeatedly, the punishment is deprivation of liberty from three to ten years.
(4) (New - SG, No. 107 of 1996) For lewdness the punishment is deprivation of liberty from three to fifteen years:
1. if committed by two or more persons;
2. (rep. - SG, No. 62 of 1997, new - SG, No. 74 of 2015) if committed with respect to a person who does not understand the nature or significance of what is being done.
3. (rep. - SG, No. 62 of 1997)
4. (rep. - SG, No. 62 of 1997)
(5) (New - SG, No. 62 of 1997) For lewdness the punishment is deprivation of liberty from five to twenty years:
1. if lewdness is committed with two or more minor persons;
2. if serious bodily injury is caused or an attempted suicide has followed;
3. if it constitutes dangerous recidivism;
4. (new - SG, No. 38 of 2007) if it constitutes a particularly serious case.
Art. 150. (1) (Am. - SG, No. 28 of 1982, in force from 01.07.1982, am. - SG, No. 89 of 1986, am. - SG, No. 107 of 1996, am. - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006, previous text of Art. 150, am. and suppl. - SG, No. 27 of 2009, am. - SG, No. 26 of 2010) Whoever commits an act with the purpose of arousing or satisfying sexual desire without intercourse with respect to a person who has attained 14 years of age, through the use of force or threat, through taking advantage of his or her helpless state or through bringing him or her into such a state or through taking advantage of a position of dependence or supervision, shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from two to eight years.
(2) (New - SG, No. 74 of 2015) The punishment under para. 1 shall also be imposed on whoever commits the act under para. 1 with respect to a minor person who engages in prostitution.
(3) (New - SG, No. 27 of 2009, am. - SG, No. 26 of 2010, previous para. 2, am. and suppl. - SG, No. 74 of 2015) When the act under para. 1 is committed with respect to a person who does not understand the nature or significance of what is being done, or the act constitutes a particularly serious case, the punishment is deprivation of liberty from three to ten years.
Art. 151. (1) (Am. - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006) Whoever has sexual intercourse with a person who has not attained 14 years of age, insofar as the act does not constitute a crime under Art. 152, shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from two to six years.
(2) (New - SG, No. 74 of 2015) When the act under para. 1 is committed:
1. through taking advantage of a position of dependence or supervision;
2. with respect to a person who has not attained 14 years of age who engages in prostitution;
3. by two or more persons, the punishment is deprivation of liberty from two to eight years.
(3) (New - SG, No. 27 of 2009, am. - SG, No. 26 of 2010, previous para. 2 - SG, No. 74 of 2015) When the act under para. 1 is committed with a minor person through taking advantage of a position of dependence or supervision, the punishment is deprivation of liberty from one to five years.
(4) (Previous para. 2 - SG, No. 27 of 2009, am. - SG, No. 26 of 2010, previous para. 3 - SG, No. 74 of 2015) Whoever has sexual intercourse with a person who has attained 14 years of age who does not understand the nature or significance of what is being done shall be punished with deprivation of liberty up to five years.
Art. 152. (1) Whoever has sexual intercourse with a person of the female sex:
1. deprived of the possibility of self-defense, and without his or her consent;
2. by compelling him or her to do so by force or threat;
3. by bringing him or her into a helpless state, shall be punished for rape with deprivation of liberty from two to eight years.
(2) For rape the punishment is deprivation of liberty from three to ten years:
1. (am. - SG, No. 92 of 2002) if the raped person has not attained eighteen years of age;
2. if she is a descendant relative;
3. (new - SG, No. 28 of 1982, in force from 01.07.1982) if committed repeatedly.
(3) (Am. - SG, No. 28 of 1982, in force from 01.07.1982) For rape the punishment is deprivation of liberty from three to fifteen years:
1. if committed by two or more persons;
2. if medium bodily injury is caused;
3. if an attempted suicide has followed;
4. (new - SG, No. 92 of 2002) if committed with the purpose of involving in subsequent depraved acts or prostitution;
5. (previous item 4 - SG, No. 92 of 2002) if it constitutes dangerous recidivism.
(4) (Am. - SG, No. 28 of 1982, in force from 01.07.1982, am. - SG, No. 92 of 2002) For rape the punishment is deprivation of liberty from ten to twenty years:
1. if the raped person has not attained fourteen years of age;
2. if serious bodily injury is caused;
3. if suicide has followed;
4. if it constitutes a particularly serious case.
Art. 153. (Am. - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006) Whoever has sexual intercourse with another person by compelling him or her to do so through taking advantage of his or her official or material dependence on him or her shall be punished with deprivation of liberty up to three years.
Art. 154. Sexual intercourse between ascendants and descendants, between brothers and sisters and between adopters and adoptees shall be punished with deprivation of liberty up to three years.
Art. 154a. (1) (New - SG, No. 27 of 2009, previous text of Art. 154a, am. - SG, No. 74 of 2015) Whoever commits lewd acts or sexual intercourse with a minor person who engages in prostitution shall be punished with deprivation of liberty up to three years.
(2) (New - SG, No. 74 of 2015) When the act under para. 1 is committed repeatedly or by two or more persons, the punishment is deprivation of liberty from one to five years.
Art. 155. (Am. - SG, No. 28 of 1982, in force from 01.07.1982) (1) (Am. - SG, No. 10 of 1993, am. - SG, No. 62 of 1997, am. - SG, No. 92 of 2002, am. - SG, No. 26 of 2004, am. - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006) Whoever inclines another person to prostitution or procures for lewd acts or sexual intercourse shall be punished with deprivation of liberty up to three years and a fine from one thousand to three thousand leva.
(2) (Am. - SG, No. 10 of 1993, am. - SG, No. 62 of 1997, am. - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006) Whoever systematically provides premises to different persons for sexual intercourse or for lewd acts shall be punished with deprivation of liberty up to five years and with a fine from one thousand to five thousand leva.
(3) (New - SG, No. 62 of 1997, am. - SG, No. 92 of 2002, am. - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006) When the acts under para. 1 and 2 are committed for profit, the punishment is deprivation of liberty from one to six years and a fine from five thousand to fifteen thousand leva.
(4) (New - SG, No. 21 of 2000, am. - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006) Whoever inclines or compels another person to use narcotic substances or their analogues with the purpose of prostitution, sexual intercourse, lewd acts or committing sexual intercourse or acts of sexual satisfaction with a person of the same sex shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from five to fifteen years and with a fine from ten thousand to fifty thousand leva.
(5) (New - SG, No. 21 of 2000, suppl. - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006, am. - SG, No. 38 of 2007) When the act under para. 1 - 4 is committed:
1. by a person who acts on the order or in execution of a decision of an organized criminal group;
2. with respect to a person who has not attained 18 years of age, or insane;
3. with respect to two or more persons;
4. repeatedly;
5. under the conditions of dangerous recidivism,
the punishment in the cases under para. 1 and 2 is deprivation of liberty from two to eight years and a fine from five thousand to fifteen thousand leva, in the cases under para. 3 - deprivation of liberty from three to ten years and a fine from ten thousand to twenty-five thousand leva, and in the cases under para. 4 - deprivation of liberty from ten to twenty years and a fine from one hundred thousand to three hundred thousand leva.
(6) (Previous para. 3 - SG, No. 62 of 1997, am. - SG, No. 62 of 1997, previous para. 4 - SG, No. 21 of 2000, rep. - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006)
(7) (Previous para. 4 - SG, No. 62 of 1997, previous para. 5 - SG, No. 21 of 2000, am. - SG, No. 92 of 2002, in force from 01.01.2005, am. regarding entry into force - SG, No. 26 of 2004, in force from 01.01.2004, rep. - SG, No. 103 of 2004, in force from 01.01.2005)
Art. 155a. (New - SG, No. 38 of 2007, am. - SG, No. 74 of 2015) (1) (Am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) Whoever through information or communication technology or in another way provides or collects information about a person who has not attained 18 years of age in order to establish contact with him or her for committing a lewd act, sexual intercourse, sexual intercourse, prostitution, for creating pornographic material or for participation in a pornographic performance shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from three to ten years and with a fine from ten thousand to twenty thousand leva.
(2) The punishment under para. 1 shall also be imposed on whoever through information or communication technology or in another way establishes contact with a person who has not attained 14 years of age with the purpose of committing a lewd act, sexual intercourse, sexual intercourse, for creating pornographic material or for participation in a pornographic performance.
Art. 155b. (1) (New - SG, No. 27 of 2009, previous text of Art. 155b, am. - SG, No. 26 of 2010, am. - SG, No. 53 of 2022, am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) Whoever inclines a person who has not attained 14 years of age to observe actual, virtual or simulated sexual intercourse between persons of the same or different sex or lascivious display of human sexual organs, sodomy, masturbation, sexual sadism or masochism shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from three to ten years.
(2) (New - SG, No. 53 of 2022, am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) Whoever inclines a person who has not attained 14 years of age to participate in actual, virtual or simulated sexual intercourse between persons of the same or different sex or lascivious display of human sexual organs, sodomy, masturbation, sexual sadism or masochism shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from five to ten years.
(3) (New - SG, No. 74 of 2015, previous para. 2 - SG, No. 53 of 2022) When the act under para. 1 is committed:
1. through the use of force or threat;
2. through taking advantage of a position of dependence or supervision;
3. by two or more persons who have conspired in advance;
4. (am. - SG, No. 53 of 2022, am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) repeatedly, the punishment is deprivation of liberty from five to fifteen years.
Art. 155c. (1) (New - SG, No. 74 of 2015, previous text of Art. 155c, am. - SG, No. 53 of 2022, am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) Whoever through the use of force or threat, or through taking advantage of a position of dependence or supervision inclines a minor person to observe actual, virtual or simulated lewd act, sexual intercourse, sexual intercourse, including sodomy, masturbation, sexual sadism or masochism, as well as lascivious display of human sexual organs, shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from three to seven years.
(2) (New - SG, No. 53 of 2022, am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) Whoever through the use of force or threat, or through taking advantage of a position of dependence or supervision inclines a minor person to participate in actual, virtual or simulated lewd act, sexual intercourse, sexual intercourse, including sodomy, masturbation, sexual sadism or masochism, as well as for lascivious display of human sexual organs, shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from three to ten years.
Art. 156. (Am. - SG, No. 10 of 1993, am. - SG, No. 62 of 1997) (1) (Am. - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006, am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) Whoever abducts another person with the purpose of being provided for depraved acts shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from three to ten years and with a fine up to ten thousand leva.
(2) (New - SG, No. 62 of 1997, am. - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006) The punishment is deprivation of liberty from five to twelve years when:
1. the abducted person has not attained 18 years of age;
2. the abducted person is provided for depraved acts, or
3. the abduction is with the purpose that the person be provided for depraved acts outside the borders of the country.
(3) (New - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006) The punishment is deprivation of liberty from five to fifteen years and a fine from five thousand to twenty thousand leva when:
1. the act is committed by a person who acts on the order or in execution of a decision of an organized criminal group;
2. the abducted person is provided for depraved acts outside the borders of the country;
3. the act constitutes dangerous recidivism.
Art. 157. (Am. - SG, No. 28 of 1982, in force from 01.07.1982, am. - SG, No. 74 of 2015) (1) Whoever commits sexual intercourse or acts of sexual satisfaction with a person of the same sex by using force or threat or taking advantage of a position of dependence or supervision, as well as with a person deprived of the possibility of self-defense, shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from two to eight years.
(2) (Am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) When the act under para. 1 is committed with respect to a minor person who engages in prostitution, the punishment is deprivation of liberty from five to ten years.
(3) (Am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) When the act under para. 1 is committed with respect to a person who has not attained 14 years of age, the punishment is deprivation of liberty from five to twelve years.
(4) (Am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) Whoever commits sexual intercourse or acts of sexual satisfaction with a person of the same sex who has not attained 14 years of age shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from three to ten years.
(5) (Am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) When the act under para. 4 is committed with respect to a person who has not attained 14 years of age who engages in prostitution, the punishment is from three to ten years.
(6) (Am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) Whoever commits sexual intercourse or acts of sexual satisfaction with a person of the same sex who has attained 14 years of age who does not understand the nature or significance of what is being done shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from three to ten years.
(7) When the act under para. 1 - 6 constitutes a particularly serious case, the punishment is deprivation of liberty from five to twenty years.
Art. 158. (Am. - SG, No. 28 of 1982, in force from 01.07.1982, rep. - SG, No. 74 of 2015)
Art. 158a. (New - SG, No. 27 of 2009, am. - SG, No. 74 of 2015) (1) (Am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) Whoever in any way recruits, assists or uses a person who has not attained 18 years of age, or a group of such persons to participate in a pornographic performance shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from three to ten years.
(2) (Am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) Whoever compels a person who has not attained 18 years of age, or a group of such persons to participate in a pornographic performance shall be punished with deprivation of liberty from three to ten years.
(3) (Am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) When the act under para. 1 or 2 is committed with respect to a person who has not attained 14 years of age, the punishment is deprivation of liberty from three to eight years.
(4) When property benefit is obtained from the act, the punishment is:
1. (am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) in the cases under para. 1 or 2 - deprivation of liberty from three to ten years and a fine from ten thousand to twenty thousand leva;
2. in the cases under para. 3 - deprivation of liberty from three to ten years and a fine from twenty thousand to fifty thousand leva.
(5) (Am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) Whoever observes a pornographic performance in which a person who has not attained 18 years of age participates shall be punished with deprivation of liberty up to five years.
Art. 158b. (New - SG, No. 74 of 2015) For a crime under Art. 149 - 157 or Art. 158a the court may also impose deprivation of a right under Art. 37, para. 1, item 6 or 7.
Art. 159. (Am. - SG, No. 28 of 1982, in force from 01.07.1982, am. - SG, No. 10 of 1993, am. - SG, No. 62 of 1997, am. - SG, No. 92 of 2002) (1) (Am. - SG, No. 38 of 2007) Whoever creates, displays, presents, broadcasts, offers, sells, rents or otherwise distributes pornographic material shall be punished with deprivation of liberty up to one year and a fine from one thousand to three thousand leva.
(2) (New - SG, No. 38 of 2007, suppl. - SG, No. 27 of 2009, am. - SG, No. 74 of 2015) Whoever distributes through information or communication technology or in another similar way pornographic material shall be punished with deprivation of liberty up to two years and a fine from one thousand to three thousand leva.
(3) (Previous para. 2, am. - SG, No. 38 of 2007, am. - SG, No. 53 of 2022) Whoever displays, presents, offers, sells, rents or otherwise distributes pornographic material to a person who has not attained 16 years of age shall be punished with deprivation of liberty up to six years and a fine up to five thousand leva.
(4) (Am. - SG, No. 75 of 2006, in force from 13.10.2006, previous para. 3, am. - SG, No. 38 of 2007, am. - SG, No. 74 of 2015, am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) For the act under para. 1 - 3 the punishment is deprivation of liberty from three to six years and a fine up to ten thousand leva when:
1. for the creation of the pornographic material a person who has not attained 18 years of age, or a person who appears as such, is used;
2. for the creation of the pornographic material a person who does not understand the nature or significance of what is being done is used;
3. committed by two or more persons;
4. committed repeatedly.
(5) (Previous para. 4, am. - SG, No. 38 of 2007, am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) When the act under para. 1 - 4 is committed on the order or in execution of a decision of an organized criminal group, the punishment is deprivation of liberty from three to ten years and a fine up to twenty thousand leva, and the court may also order confiscation of part or all of the perpetrator's property.
(6) (Previous para. 5, am. - SG, No. 38 of 2007, am. - SG, No. 74 of 2015, am. - SG, No. 67 of 2023) Whoever holds or procures for himself or herself or for another through information or communication technology or in another way pornographic material for the creation of which a person who has not attained 18 years of age, or a person who appears as such, is used shall be punished with deprivation of liberty up to five years and with a fine up to ten thousand leva.
(7) (New - SG, No. 74 of 2015) The punishment under para. 6 shall also be imposed on whoever through information or communication technology knowingly accesses pornographic material for the creation of which a person who has not attained 18 years of age, or a person who appears as such, is used.
(8) (New - SG, No. 74 of 2015) In the cases under para. 1 - 7 the court may also impose deprivation of a right under Art. 37, para. 1, item 6 or 7.
(9) (Previous para. 6 - SG, No. 38 of 2007, previous para. 7 - SG, No. 74 of 2015) The object of the crime shall be forfeited in favor of the state, and if it is missing or has been alienated, its equivalent value shall be awarded.

