§ 38. This law implements the requirements of

1. Directive 2009/123/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council of 21 October 2009 amending Directive 2005/35/EC on ship-source pollution and on the introduction of penalties for infringements (OJ, L 280/52 of 27 October 2009);
2. Directive 2008/99/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council of 19 November 2008 on the protection of the environment through criminal law (OJ, L 328/28 of 6 December 2008);
3. Framework Decision 2008/675/JHA of the Council of 24 July 2008 on taking account of convictions in the Member States of the European Union in the course of new criminal proceedings (OJ, L 220/32 of 15 August 2008);
4. Framework Decision 2008/919/JHA of the Council of 28 November 2008 amending Framework Decision 2002/475/JHA on combating terrorism (OJ, L 330/21 of 9 December 2008);
5. Framework Decision 2008/913/JHA of the Council of 28 November 2008 on combating certain forms and expressions of racism and xenophobia by means of criminal law (OJ, L 328/55 of 6 December 2008).
